"/us/en/neurovascular/c/driven-by-evidence": {"template":"base","metadata":{"title":"Driven by Evidence","pageTitle":null,"description":"At Stryker, we are driven by clinical evidence and committed to proving the safety and effectiveness of our products in treating the toughest stroke cases.","image":null,"imageAlt":null,"tags":["stryker:business-unit/neurovascular"],"originallyPublished":"2023-02-06T19:48:35.000Z","lastPublished":"2025-01-08T21:18:25.000Z","contentID":"AP003782 v3.0"},"anchors":[{"id":"hemorrhagic","title":"hemorrhagic","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"par"},{"id":"studies-hemorrhagic","title":"Hemorrhagic stroke studies","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"par"},{"id":"acute","title":"acute","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"par"},{"id":"studies-ischemic","title":"Acute Ischemic stroke studies","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"par"}],"disclaimer":"<p>Information contained herein for healthcare professionals in the US only. All illustrations are artist's renditions.</p>\r\n<p>Stryker or its affiliated entities own, use, or have applied for the following trademarks or service marks: Nano, Stryker, Target. All other trademarks are trademarks of their respective owners or holders.</p>\r\n<p>The absence of a product, feature, or service name, or logo from this list does not constitute a waiver of Stryker’s trademark or other intellectual property rights concerning that name or logo.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>*The safety and effectiveness of Y-stenting has not been established.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Copyright © 2024 Stryker<br>\r\n</p>","forms":[{"formId":"1439","afterSubmitAction":"showMessage","message":"Thank you for your submission.","useProduction":true}],"tabs":[],"cardLists":[],"missingAlt":[]},
"/us/en/neurovascular/c/driven-by-evidence/assist-registry": {"template":"base","metadata":{"title":"Assist Registry","pageTitle":null,"description":null,"image":null,"imageAlt":null,"tags":["stryker:content-type/hcp_content"],"originallyPublished":"2023-02-06T22:16:47.000Z","lastPublished":"2026-01-09T22:16:47.000Z","contentID":"AP004819 v1.0"},"anchors":[],"disclaimer":"<p>This information is intended solely for the use of healthcare professionals.</p>\r\n<p>A physician must always rely on his or her own professional clinical judgment when deciding whether to use a particular product when treating a particular&nbsp;patient. Stryker does not dispense medical advice and recommends that physicians be trained in the use of any particular product before using it in a procedure.&nbsp;The information presented is intended to demonstrate the breadth of Stryker product offerings. A physician must always refer to the package insert, product label&nbsp;and/or instructions for use before using any Stryker product. Products may not be available in all markets because product availability is subject to the regulatory&nbsp;and/or medical practices in individual markets. Please contact your Stryker representative if you have questions about the availability of Stryker products in your&nbsp;area.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nStryker or its affiliated entities own, use, or have applied for the following trademarks or service marks: AXS Infinity LS, AXS Vecta, AXS Catalyst, FlowGate², Trevo NXT, Trevo Trak, Total Stroke, Stryker. All other trademarks are&nbsp;trademarks of their respective owners or holders.&nbsp;<br>\r\n<br>\r\nThe absence of a product, feature, or service name, or logo from this list does not constitute a waiver of Stryker’s trademark or other intellectual property rights&nbsp;concerning that name or logo.</p>","forms":[],"tabs":[],"cardLists":[],"missingAlt":[]},
"/us/en/neurovascular/c/driven-by-evidence/atlas-ide-study": {"template":"base","metadata":{"title":"ATLAS IDE Study","pageTitle":null,"description":null,"image":null,"imageAlt":null,"tags":[],"originallyPublished":"2023-02-06T21:45:33.000Z","lastPublished":"2026-05-29T15:00:06.000Z","contentID":"AP005074 v3.0"},"anchors":[{"id":"three-year-outcomes","title":"ATLAS study 3-year outcomes","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"par"},{"id":"one-year-outcomes","title":"Atlas study 1-year outcomes","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"par"},{"id":"dbe","title":"Additional Evidence","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"par"},{"id":"contact","title":"Contact us","hidden":true,"type":"section-title","area":"par"}],"disclaimer":"<p>* The&nbsp;ATLAS study was sponsored by Stryker.</p>\r\n<p>This document is intended solely for the use of healthcare professionals.</p>\r\n<p>A physician must always rely on his or her own professional clinical judgment when deciding whether to use a particular product when treating a particular patient. Stryker does not dispense medical advice and recommends that physicians be trained in the use of any particular product before using it in a procedure. The information presented is intended to demonstrate the breadth of Stryker product offerings. A physician must always refer to the package insert, product label and/or instructions for use before using any Stryker product. Products may not be available in all markets because product availability is subject to the regulatory and/or medical practices in individual markets. Please contact your Stryker representative if you have questions about the availability of Stryker products in your area.</p>\r\n<p>Stryker or its affiliated entities own, use, or have applied for the following trademarks or service marks: Neuroform Atlas, Stryker. All other trademarks are trademarks of their respective owners or holders.</p>\r\n<p>The absence of a product, feature, or service name, or logo from this list does not constitute a waiver of Stryker’s trademark or other intellectual property rights concerning that name or logo.</p>","forms":[{"formId":"1439","afterSubmitAction":"showMessage","message":"Thank you for your submission.","useProduction":true}],"tabs":[["Anterior","Posterior"],["Anterior","Posterior","Y-Stenting subset","MCA subset","Jailing vs. recrossing subset"]],"cardLists":[],"missingAlt":[]},
